# Jolene, Plundering Pugilist: the ping is "any target" (CR 115.4), so it also hits a creature: Bot2 casts a Memnite (1/1) on
# turn 2, Jolene attacks on turn 3 (Bot2 does not block; 20 -> 16) and the sacrificed Treasure pays for 1 damage to the
# Memnite, which dies. The player-target version is the neighbouring scenario.

[Bot1 Deck]
Jolene, Plundering Pugilist
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mountain
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Jolene, Plundering Pugilist.Cast(Spend: R, G, B)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T3 Bot1.BeginCombat]
Bot1.Attack(Jolene, Plundering Pugilist > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Treasure Token.Token = true
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Jolene, Plundering Pugilist.Activate(Ability: Sacrifice a Treasure; Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 16
Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite = (absent)
Bot2.Graveyard = Memnite
